"entity": {
"name": "Karur Vysya Bank Ltd.",
"description": "Karur Vysya Bank Ltd. engages in the provision of delivering banking solutions with leveraging its customer-centric approach. It operates through the following segments: Treasury, Corporate and Wholesale Banking, Retail Banking, and Other Banking Operations. The Retail Banking segment includes lending and other banking services to individuals and small business customers, other than corporate and wholesale banking customers. The company was founded by Athi Krishna Chettiar and M. A. Venkatarama Chettiar on June 22, 1916 and is headquartered in Karur, India.",
